        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-parameter-expressivity-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-repro-package> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting, with time-dependent Nodal/TGF-beta coupling (Pass 3) — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Deterministic RNG (seed 2008 everywhere, L450, L637, L788); `--self-test` runs 13 checks in ~13 s (L1704-L1810) including SHA-256 integrity, Lean-parity tension values, Young-Dupré bounds, the three static regimes, 3-layer stratification, specimen correlation, two-run bitwise determinism of both the static and the Nodal-coupled sorter, the Nodal dose map, the closure inequality, the relaxation invariant, the shield-stage tier counts and the Nodal-null control, and the 13-measurement contract; the default render regenerates the PNG and both GIFs in ~12 s with the printed summary (L1836-L1871). Deductions: no requirements lock file is vendored for this slot, the environment block above is the venv at audit time (-4); without MPLCONFIGDIR set matplotlib writes a font cache outside the repository and prints warnings (-2); PNG byte-identity across runs was not asserted (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
