    pk1:evidenceAgainst "datasets/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting_reference.json L75–L88: Specimen metadata: Wikimedia 'Whole blastoderm transplants show yolk cell domain of function' — a transplant proxy, not a germ-layer aggregate <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/datasets/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting/differential_interfacial_tension_sorting_reference.json#L75-L88>" ;
