<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Maître et al. (2012) Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Contact Angle & Normalized Contact Radius Law" ;
    dct:description "Determines the equilibrium geometry of adhering zebrafish progenitor doublets from the ratio of cell-cell interfacial tension to cell-medium cortical tension | Variables: θ: equilibrium cell-doublet contact half-angle; γ_{cc}: cell-cell interfacial tension; γ_{cm}: cell-medium cortical tension; r_c/R_{cell}: normalized contact radius" ;
    dct:source "Maître et al. (2012) Science 338(6104):253-256 Eq. (1) & Figs. 1-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L148-L190>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L65-L89> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def young_dupre_num (gamma_cm gamma_cc : Int) : Int :=
  2 * gamma_cm - gamma_cc
theorem maitre_2012_young_dupre_contact_bounds (gamma_cm gamma_cc dgamma : Int) :
    young_dupre_num gamma_cm (2 * gamma_cm) = 0 ∧
    young_dupre_num gamma_cm 0 = 2 * gamma_cm ∧
    young_dupre_num gamma_cm (gamma_cc + dgamma) = young_dupre_num gamma_cm gamma_cc - dgamma"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "cos(θ) = 1 - γ_{cc} / (2 γ_{cm}),  r_c / R_{cell} = sin(θ) = √(1 - cos^2(θ))" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.young_dupre_num" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.maitre_2012_young_dupre_contact_bounds" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Nodal/TGF-β Dose → Cortical Tension Target (monotone, bounded, Nodal-null ⇒ ectoderm)" ;
    dct:description "Couples time-dependent Nodal/TGF-β morphogen signalling to DITH cortical tension: Nodal-blocked (lefty1 / MZoep) cells stay at ectoderm tension and cannot sort, graded Nodal dose sets mesoderm and endoderm tensions | Variables: C: marginal Nodal (Squint/Cyclops) signal relative to the saturating dose C0; K_M, K_N: mesoderm / endoderm dose thresholds; β_E, β_M, β_N: Krieg et al. (2008) AFM cortical tensions (pN/μm)" ;
    dct:source "Krieg et al. (2008) Nature Cell Biology 10(4):429-436 Fig. 1 (progenitors induced by lefty1 / cyclops / cyclops+casanova); Gritsman et al. (1999) Cell 97(1):121-132; Chen & Schier (2001) Nature 411:607-610; Dubrulle et al. (2015) eLife 4:e05042; van Boxtel et al. (2015) Dev. Cell 35(2):175-185; Hagos & Dougan (2007) BMC Dev. Biol. 7:22" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L232-L282>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L90-L116> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def nodal_tension_target (C K_M K_N : Int) : Int :=
  if C < K_M then 50 else if C < K_N then 95 else 130
theorem nodal_dose_cortical_tension_monotone_bounded (C₁ C₂ K_M K_N : Int)
    (hC : C₁ ≤ C₂) (h0 : 0 < K_M) :
    nodal_tension_target C₁ K_M K_N ≤ nodal_tension_target C₂ K_M K_N ∧
    (50 ≤ nodal_tension_target C₁ K_M K_N ∧ nodal_tension_target C₁ K_M K_N ≤ 130) ∧
    dith_spreading_diff (nodal_tension_target 0 K_M K_N) (nodal_tension_target 0 K_M K_N) = 0 ∧
    nodal_tension_target 0 K_M K_N = 50"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "β*(C) = β_E + (β_M − β_E) H(C;K_M) + (β_N − β_M) H(C;K_N),  H(C;K) = C^n/(K^n + C^n);  sharp-threshold limit: β* = 50 (C<K_M), 95 (K_M≤C<K_N), 130 (C≥K_N)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.nodal_tension_target" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.nodal_dose_cortical_tension_monotone_bounded" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Continuous-Cortex DITH Closure Satisfies the Krieg (2008) Engulfment Inequality" ;
    dct:description "Guarantees that as Nodal differentiates two cortices the resulting DITH tensions always fall in Krieg et al. (2008) regime I (higher-tension mesendoderm engulfed by lower-tension ectoderm), reproducing γ_EM = 30 pN/μm at the wild-type anchor and the Blebbistatin-like null at equal tensions | Variables: β_i, β_j: per-cell time-dependent cortical tensions set by Nodal dose; κ: closure slope (0 ≤ κ < 1); γ_{ij}: heterotypic interfacial tension (3γ_{ij} = 2|β_i − β_j| in the integer-scaled Lean form)" ;
    dct:source "Brodland (2002) J. Biomech. Eng. 124(2):188-197 Eq. (1); Krieg et al. (2008) Nature Cell Biology 10(4):429-436 Figs. 2-4; Maître et al. (2012) Science 338(6104):253-256 (cortex coupling rationale)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L776-L1001>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L117-L144> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cortex_mismatch_gamma3 (beta_i beta_j : Int) : Int :=
  2 * (if beta_i ≥ beta_j then beta_i - beta_j else beta_j - beta_i)
theorem cortex_mismatch_closure_satisfies_engulfment (beta_i beta_j : Int) :
    (beta_i ≠ beta_j →
      0 < cortex_mismatch_gamma3 beta_i beta_j ∧
      cortex_mismatch_gamma3 beta_i beta_j < 3 * (if beta_i ≥ beta_j then beta_i - beta_j else beta_j - beta_i)) ∧
    cortex_mismatch_gamma3 beta_i beta_i = 0 ∧
    cortex_mismatch_gamma3 50 95 = 90"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "γ_{i0} = β_i,  γ_{ij} = γ_hom + κ|β_i − β_j| (κ = 2/3, γ_hom = 0)  ⇒  β_i ≠ β_j → 0 < γ_{ij} < |γ_{i0} − γ_{j0}|;  β_i = β_j → γ_{ij} = 0;  γ_{EM}(50, 95) = 30" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.cortex_mismatch_gamma3" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.cortex_mismatch_closure_satisfies_engulfment" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Pass 3 — Cortical Tension Relaxation Toward the Nodal-Set Target Never Overshoots" ;
    dct:description "Shows the time-dependent cortical tension dynamics stay inside [β_E, β_N] whenever the Nodal-set target does, so the DITH hierarchy emerges monotonically between sphere (4 hpf) and shield (6 hpf) | Variables: β: current cortical tension; β*: Nodal-set target tension; τ_β: actomyosin cortex relaxation time (0.5 h); dt: MCS → hpf step" ;
    dct:source "Krieg et al. (2008) Nature Cell Biology 10(4):429-436 (AFM hierarchy present at shield stage); Hagos & Dougan (2007) BMC Dev. Biol. 7:22 (time-dependent specification); Kimmel et al. (1995) Dev. Dyn. 203(3):253-310 (staging)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L303-L334>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L146-L163> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cortex_relax_step (beta target : Int) : Int :=
  beta + (target - beta) / 4
theorem cortical_tension_relaxation_contracts (beta target : Int) :
    (beta ≤ target → beta ≤ cortex_relax_step beta target ∧ cortex_relax_step beta target ≤ target) ∧
    (target ≤ beta → target ≤ cortex_relax_step beta target ∧ cortex_relax_step beta target ≤ beta)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dβ/dt = (β*(C(x,t)) − β)/τ_β;  Euler step β' = β + (β* − β)·dt/τ_β (dt/τ_β = 1/4):  β ≤ β* → β ≤ β' ≤ β*  and  β* ≤ β → β* ≤ β' ≤ β" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.cortex_relax_step" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.cortical_tension_relaxation_contracts" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) Differential Interfacial Tension Law & Blebbistatin Equal-Cortex Null Identity" ;
    dct:description "Decomposes macroscopic cell-cell interfacial tension into actomyosin cortical tension minus cadherin adhesion and proves that Myosin-II inhibition zeroes the sorting force | Variables: β_α^{cort}, β_β^{cort}: actomyosin cell-cortex tensions; ω_{αβ}^{adh}: cadherin adhesion energy; γ_{αβ}: effective cell-cell interfacial tension" ;
    dct:source "Brodland (2002) J. Biomech. Eng. 124(2):188-197 Eqs. (1)-(4); Krieg et al. (2008) Nature Cell Biology 10(4):429-436 Fig. 3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L97-L145>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L17-L40> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def dith_gamma_ab (beta_a beta_b omega_ab : Int) : Int :=
  beta_a + beta_b - omega_ab
theorem dith_blebbistatin_equal_cortex_null_sorting (beta : Int) :
    dith_gamma_ab beta beta (2 * beta) = 0 ∧ dith_spreading_diff beta beta = 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "γ_{αβ} = β_α^{cort} + β_β^{cort} - ω_{αβ}^{adh},  γ_{α0} = β_α^{cort};  β_E = β_M = β ⇒ γ_{M0} - γ_{E0} = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.dith_gamma_ab" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.dith_blebbistatin_equal_cortex_null_sorting" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Krieg et al. (2008) Zebrafish Germ-Layer Cortical Tension Hierarchy & caMLCK Sorting Reversal" ;
    dct:description "Predicts concentric germ-layer engulfment in wild-type zebrafish gastrulae and sorting reversal when ectodermal cortex tension is elevated via caMLCK | Variables: β_E, β_M, β_N: AFM cortical tensions of zebrafish ectoderm, mesoderm, and endoderm progenitors (pN/μm); γ_{EM}: ectoderm-mesoderm interfacial tension" ;
    dct:source "Krieg et al. (2008) Nature Cell Biology 10(4):429-436 Figs. 1-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/2002-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting.py#L284-L617>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8beed34/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean#L42-L63> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """theorem krieg_2008_germ_layer_hierarchy_and_camlc_reversal :
    (50 < 95 ∧ 95 < 130) ∧
    dith_gamma_ab 50 95 115 = 30 ∧
    dith_spreading_diff 50 95 = 45 ∧
    (0 < dith_gamma_ab 50 95 115 ∧ dith_gamma_ab 50 95 115 < dith_spreading_diff 50 95) ∧
    dith_spreading_diff 145 95 = -50 ∧
    (0 < dith_gamma_ab 145 95 210 ∧ dith_gamma_ab 145 95 210 < dith_spreading_diff 95 145)"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Wild-type: β_E (50) < β_M (95) < β_N (130 pN/μm), 0 < γ_{EM} < β_M - β_E;  caMLCK ectoderm: β_{E+caMLCK} (145) > β_M (95) ⇒ inverted engulfment" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/aja.1002030302>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80720-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2015.09.014>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/35079121>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb1705>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-017-00146-x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0704252104>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.1449491>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1225399>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-213X-7-22>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.126.4.827>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.05042> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) & Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Mechanics" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.dith_spreading_diff" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_044.krieg_2008_germ_layer_hierarchy_and_camlc_reversal" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Maître et al. (2012) Young-Dupré Cell-Doublet Contact Angle & Normalized Contact Radius Law" ;
    dct:description "Determines the equilibrium geometry of adhering zebrafish progenitor doublets from the ratio of cell-cell interfacial tension to cell-medium cortical tension | Variables: θ: equilibrium cell-doublet contact half-angle; γ_{cc}: cell-cell interfacial tension; γ_{cm}: cell-medium cortical tension; r_c/R_{cell}: normalized contact radius" ;
    dct:source "Maître et al. (2012) Science 338(6104):253-256 Eq. (1) & Figs. 1-3" ;
